{
  "name": "Tasks / 任务",
  "description": "Every need, bug and improvement, from first request to done. / 每一个需求、缺陷和优化，从提出到完成。",
  "position": 2,
  "agentPrompts": [
    {
      "key": "intake",
      "label": {
        "en": "Turn notes into tasks",
        "zh-CN": "把会议纪要拆成任务"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "{target}\n\nRead the `busa-rnd` skill in this folder, then the `rnd-prd` skill, and follow them. Split the text I paste into separate tasks: one need per task, the right product and type, the person who asked, and acceptance criteria written as what a user can see. Check for duplicates first and show me the list before writing.",
        "zh-CN": "{target}\n\n先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-rnd` Skill，再读 `rnd-prd` Skill，按它们的流程做。把我贴的内容拆成独立的任务：一件事一条，选对产品和类型，写上提出人，验收标准写成「用户能看到什么」。先查重，写入前先给我看清单。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "pick-up",
      "label": {
        "en": "Pick up the next task and start coding",
        "zh-CN": "领一个任务开始写代码"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "{target}\n\nRead the `busa-rnd` skill in this folder, then the `rnd-coder` skill, and follow them. Take the task I name (or the highest-priority To do task in this repository's product), mark it In progress with yourself as assignee, then implement it on a branch and keep the record updated through review and merge.",
        "zh-CN": "{target}\n\n先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-rnd` Skill，再读 `rnd-coder` Skill，按它们的流程做。领我指定的任务（没指定就领本仓库所属产品里优先级最高的「待开始」任务），改成「进行中」并把自己写成负责人，然后在分支上实现，评审和合并时同步更新这条记录。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "groom",
      "label": {
        "en": "Groom the backlog and suggest priorities",
        "zh-CN": "整理需求池并建议优先级"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "{target}\n\nRead the `busa-rnd` skill in this folder, then the `rnd-prd` skill, and follow them. Read the backlog, merge duplicates, flag tasks with no acceptance criteria, and propose a priority for each with a one-line reason. Apply nothing until I confirm.",
        "zh-CN": "{target}\n\n先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-rnd` Skill，再读 `rnd-prd` Skill，按它们的流程做。读需求池：合并重复项，标出没写验收标准的任务，为每条建议优先级并附一句理由。我确认之前不要改。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "check-acceptance",
      "label": {
        "en": "Check that open tasks have acceptance criteria",
        "zh-CN": "检查未完成的任务是否都写了验收标准"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "{target}\n\nRead the `busa-rnd` skill in this folder, then the `rnd-prd` skill, and follow them. List open tasks whose acceptance criteria are missing or not testable, and suggest a rewrite for each. Do not change anything.",
        "zh-CN": "{target}\n\n先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-rnd` Skill，再读 `rnd-prd` Skill，按它们的流程做。列出验收标准缺失或无法验证的未完成任务，并给每条建议改写。不要修改任何记录。"
      },
      "intent": "read-only"
    }
  ],
